      "title": "Sari's Online Shop",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Sari is a high school student in Surabaya. Three months ago, she opened a small online shop. She sells handmade bracelets and keychains.",
        "Every afternoon, after school, Sari makes new products. Her little brother helps her pack the orders. On Saturdays, she sends all the packages by post.",
        "Last week, Sari got fifty orders in one day! She was very busy but also very proud. She is saving the money to buy a new laptop for school."
      ],
